WEBVTT

00:11:29.461 --> 00:11:32.522
Every system might have some degree

00:11:32.522 --> 00:11:36.247
of consciousness.

00:11:36.247 --> 00:11:39.208
This view is sometimes called panpsychism:

00:11:39.208 --> 00:11:42.210
pan for all, psych for mind,

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:43.981
every system is conscious,

00:11:43.981 --> 00:11:48.228
not just humans, dogs, mice, flies,

00:11:48.228 --> 00:11:50.805
but even Rob Knight's microbes,

00:11:50.805 --> 00:11:52.992
elementary particles.

00:11:52.992 --> 00:11:55.705
Even a photon has some degree of consciousness.

00:11:55.705 --> 00:11:59.484
The idea is not that photons are intelligent

00:11:59.484 --> 00:12:00.561
or thinking.